00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:23,550
与你一起在这里，站在我们亲朋好友的面前
standing here with you in front of our family and friends is

312
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,590
我内心感慨万千
bringing up a lot of feelings.

313
00:17:26,550 --> 00:17:29,590
比如想到我们第一次私奔结婚是多好的主意
Like what a good idea it was to elope the first time.

314
00:17:31,890 --> 00:17:35,060
但也想到你让我无比快乐
But also how incredibly happy you make me.

315
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:39,860
谢谢你娶了我,希望这是你最后一次娶我了
Thank you for marrying me.Hopefully for the last time.

316
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:44,110
佩妮
Penny...

317
00:17:45,110 --> 00:17:48,410
作为一名科学家，我的职责是搞懂事物发生的原因
as a scientist,my job is to figure out why things happen.

318
00:17:48,570 --> 00:17:51,450
但我想我永远搞不懂
But I don't think I'll ever understand

319
00:17:51,620 --> 00:17:56,080
我这样的凡夫俗子，怎能有幸与你共度一生
how someone like me could get to be with someone like you.

320
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,370
或许...或许
You know... maybe...

321
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:02,710
我不需要搞懂，我只需感谢天赐良缘，我爱你，佩妮
I don't need to understand it,I just need to be grateful.I love you, Penny.

322
00:18:06,170 --> 00:18:08,630
有人对此有啥毒舌言论要发表吗
Anybody have anything snarky to say about that?

323
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:12,300
我也觉得不会有
Didn't think so.

324
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:16,600
我想说两句
I'd like to say something.

325
00:18:16,930 --> 00:18:20,650
贝弗莉，我知道我们没有让对方成为最好的自己
Beverly,I know that we don't bring out the best in each other.

326
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:24,150
但我们的结合还是带来了一件美好事物
But something wonderful did come from our relationship:

327
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:26,570
就是前面这个好小伙
that young man right there.

328
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,030
我非常同意
I couldn't agree more.

329
00:18:31,990 --> 00:18:33,030
太感人了
That's beautiful.

330
00:18:35,830 --> 00:18:38,960
-谢谢，好了，我们继续  -抱歉
-Thank you. All right, let's continue.   -Yeah, excuse me,

331
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:43,880
我也有话想对一位很特别的人说
I need to say something to someone pretty special,

332
00:18:44,250 --> 00:18:46,880
而且...我一刻都多等不了
and...I just can't wait any longer.

333
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:50,010
-守得云开见月明啊   -莱纳德
-It's happening.   -Leonard...

334
00:18:54,350 --> 00:18:56,470
你我之间起起伏伏  有好有坏
You and I have our ups and downs.

335
00:18:56,970 --> 00:19:00,310
但一直以来我始终把你当家人看待
But I have always considered you my family.

336
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:03,360
是在我们父母如两只老兔子般疯狂交配前
Even before the recent threat of our parents fornicating

337
00:19:03,520 --> 00:19:05,900
我就一直把你当家人
like wrinkly old rabbits.

338
00:19:10,950 --> 00:19:14,780
虽然我不常表现出来，但你对我无比重要
I don't always show it,but you are of great importance to me.

339
00:19:16,990 --> 00:19:17,990
你们俩都是
Both of you.

340
00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:20,750
谢谢
Thank you.

341
00:19:21,580 --> 00:19:22,620
好了
Okay.

342
00:19:23,170 --> 00:19:25,540
我现在宣布你们为夫妻
I now pronounce you husband and wife.

343
00:19:27,090 --> 00:19:29,380
外加随公寓附赠的另一位怪丈夫
And weird other husband who came with the apartment.

344
00:19:38,390 --> 00:19:40,390
谢谢你载我们去机场
Thank you for taking us to the airport.

345
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:43,230
我很开心我们一家能和平共处一会儿
Hey, I'm just thrilled we're all getting along for a minute.

346
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,560
我也是
Yeah, me, too.

347
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:47,070
贝弗莉  我如果惹你不开心了  对不起
Beverly, I'm sorry if I upset you.

348
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,860
过了就算了  阿尔弗雷德
Water under the bridge, Alfred.

349
00:19:50,190 --> 00:19:52,200
莱纳德  你为什么不开上共乘车道
Leonard, why don't you get into the carpool lane?

350
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:54,240
那里是实线 他不能切过去
Well, that's a solid line. He can't cross it.

351
00:19:54,410 --> 00:19:55,450
没事  我可以切过去
That's okay. I can make it over.

352
00:19:55,620 --> 00:19:59,160
不必不必，就慢悠悠地开吧，这么开你父亲会舒服点
No, no, let's plod along.It'll make your father feel more comfortable.

353
00:20:00,790 --> 00:20:03,750
真正让我感到舒心的是想到明早不用一起床
What makes me comfortable is knowing I don't have to wake up tomorrow morning

354
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:05,750
就看见你那张臭脸
and see your sour face.

355
00:20:07,460 --> 00:20:10,300
善待这个世界  明早别醒来了
Do the world a favor and don't wake up tomorrow morning.

356
00:20:13,470 --> 00:20:14,930
和平了快整整一分钟呢
It was almost a minute.

357
00:20:17,760 --> 00:20:20,270
好多车啊  不会赶不上吧
There's a lot of traffic. Are we gonna be okay?

358
00:20:20,470 --> 00:20:22,140
你会在你飞机起飞前一个小时到达机场
You'll be at the airport an hour before your flight.

359
00:20:22,310 --> 00:20:23,350
很好  谢谢
Good. Thank you.

360
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:26,770
有足够时间让你再找一个"老"白脸
Plenty of time for you to meet another geriatric boy toy.

361
00:20:28,940 --> 00:20:31,740
喂  我不许你不尊重我
Hey. I will not have you be disrespectful to me.

362
00:20:31,900 --> 00:20:32,940
是的  母亲大人
Yes, ma'am.

363
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:35,160
谢尔顿  你的母亲是一位很有魅力的女子
Sheldon, your mother's an attractive woman.

364
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:38,280
你得习惯男人们会对她趋之若鹜
You need to get used to the fact that men are gonna be interested in her.

365
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:41,540
你也得闭嘴开车  少多管闲事
And you need to drive the car and mind your business.

366
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:44,620
我也不许你不尊重我
I will not have you be disrespectful to me.

367
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:47,250
-你又不是我妈   -你不许不尊重她
-What...you're not my mother.   -Don't you be disrespectful to her!

368
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:48,540
是的  大人
Yes, ma'am.

369
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:53,170
慢慢来  多加鞭策就行了
You'll get there, you've just got to put some zing on it.

370
00:20:57,010 --> 00:20:59,300
佩妮  我真不知道我之前瞎担心什么
Penny, I don't know what I was worried about.

371
00:20:59,470 --> 00:21:01,140
你的朋友们都很讨人喜欢啊
Your friends are just lovely.

372
00:21:01,390 --> 00:21:02,470
谢谢啊  妈妈
Oh, thanks, Mom.

373
00:21:02,770 --> 00:21:05,980
除了那个谢尔顿有点"特别"
Although that Sheldon is a bit peculiar.

374
00:21:07,310 --> 00:21:09,150
是吗？从来没注意到啊
Is he? I never noticed.

375
00:21:10,820 --> 00:21:14,360
他让我想起我们家养过的那只火鸡，看雨看到被雨水呛死了
He reminds me of that turkey we had who drowned looking up at the rain.

376
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:17,410
这也可以！
That was great.

377
00:21:17,660 --> 00:21:19,570
条子  条子  要淡定
Cops, cops, be cool!

